{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://bdb.local/contracts/master/asset.v1.3.schema.json",
  "title": "Master asset (assets/{asset_id}) — v1.3",
  "description": "Documento raiz de un fondo/ETF de la maestra. v1.3 es superconjunto compatible de v1.2: todo documento v1.2 valido sigue siendo valido. Anade classification.official_benchmark: el indice de referencia oficial del fondo, con el texto de la fuente, o null si la fuente no lo declara. El extractor ya lo traia en la ficha y se perdia al construir el canonico. Desde v1.2: (1) x-owner por bloque: 'plataforma' = lo reescribe el republish desde el canonico; 'app' = lo escribe 3-BDB-ACTIVOS_app y el republish lo conserva; 'legado' = sin escritor vigente, se conserva y solo cambia por migracion; 'metadatos' = sello de escritura. (2) regulatory y provenance del extractor. (3) costes con evidencia (KID y documentos). (4) risk.sri_kid_evidence tipado. (5) source_metadata.source MANUAL_DOCUMENTARY para altas documentales fuera del canonico (todo el documento es de la app hasta que el activo entre en el extractor). Los bloqueos operativos de seleccion NO viven aqui: son de la app (asset_selection_controls).",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "asset_id",
    "asset_type",
    "identity",
    "product",
    "quality",
    "source_metadata"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "asset_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[A-Z]{2}[A-Z0-9]{9}[0-9]$",
      "description": "ISIN.",
      "x-owner": "metadatos"
    },
    "asset_type": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "FUND",
        "ETF",
        "STOCK",
        "INDEX",
        "OTHER",
        "UNKNOWN"
      ],
      "x-owner": "plataforma"
    },
    "schema_version": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "ADITIVO. Para esta version: 'master.asset.v1.3'.",
      "x-owner": "metadatos"
    },
    "updated_at": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "ADITIVO. ISO timestamp de la ultima escritura.",
      "x-owner": "metadatos"
    },
    "identity": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "name"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "currency": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        }
      },
      "x-owner": "plataforma"
    },
    "identifiers": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "isin": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "ticker": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "eodhd_code": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "aliases": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "x-owner": "plataforma"
    },
    "listings": {
      "type": "array",
      "description": "Listings embebidos resueltos. Para ETF listable sin listing resuelto se permite [].",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/listing"
      },
      "x-owner": "plataforma"
    },
    "classification": {
      "type": [
        "object",
        "null"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "asset_class": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "fondosdb_asset_class": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "fondosdb_asset_type": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "asset_subtype": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "region_primary": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "strategy_tags": {
          "type": [
            "array",
            "null"
          ],
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "confidence": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "morningstar_rating": {
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ],
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 5
        },
        "official_benchmark": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "minLength": 1,
          "description": "Indice de referencia oficial, tal como lo publica la fuente. Nunca un marcador de ausencia ('N/A', 'no disponible'): si la fuente no lo declara, va null."
        }
      },
      "x-owner": "plataforma"
    },
    "product": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "product_type",
        "has_listing"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "product_type": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "commercial_type": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "vehicle_complexity": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "fund_name": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "has_listing": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      },
      "x-owner": "plataforma"
    },
    "costs": {
      "type": [
        "object",
        "null"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "management_fee_pct": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "ter_pct": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "mifid_ongoing_pct": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "retrocession": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "LEGADO: la retrocesion vive en commercial_retro/{isin} (app); no se escribe aqui."
        },
        "entry_fee_max_pct": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "Coste de entrada maximo (KID PRIIPs, % sobre la inversion)."
        },
        "exit_fee_max_pct": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "Coste de salida maximo (KID PRIIPs)."
        },
        "transaction_costs_pct": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "Costes de operacion anuales (KID PRIIPs)."
        },
        "performance_fee_pct": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "Comision de rendimiento como IMPACTO anual (tabla de composicion de costes del KID). No es el tipo contractual."
        },
        "performance_fee_rate_pct": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "Tipo contractual de la comision de exito (p.ej. 15 % sobre el exceso frente al indice)."
        },
        "performance_fee_basis": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "Base de calculo de la comision de exito, en texto."
        },
        "ongoing_costs_kid_pct": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "Gestion y otros costes administrativos o de funcionamiento (KID PRIIPs)."
        },
        "depositary_fee_pct": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "service_fee_pct": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "as_of_date": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "note": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "source": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "kid_evidence": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/documentEvidence"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "evidence": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/documentEvidence"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "x-owner": "plataforma"
    },
    "performance": {
      "type": [
        "object",
        "null"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "description": "Passthrough del export universal; performance.valuation es de la app (price_refresh) y el republish la conserva.",
      "x-owner-exceptions": {
        "valuation": "app"
      },
      "x-owner": "plataforma"
    },
    "fundamentals": {
      "type": [
        "object",
        "null"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "description": "LEGADO: resumen fundamental de ETF sin escritor versionado. Se conserva; no lo produce el mapper.",
      "x-owner": "legado"
    },
    "risk": {
      "type": [
        "object",
        "null"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "properties": {
        "sri_kid_evidence": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/sriKidEvidence",
          "x-owner": "plataforma"
        }
      },
      "description": "Passthrough del bloque riesgo del export universal + sri_kid_evidence derivada de regulatory.kid.",
      "x-owner": "plataforma"
    },
    "sustainability": {
      "type": [
        "object",
        "null"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "x-owner": "plataforma"
    },
    "portfolio_exposure": {
      "type": [
        "object",
        "null"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "description": "Passthrough de portfolio_exposure_v2 (fracciones 0-1).",
      "x-owner": "plataforma"
    },
    "fixed_income_profile": {
      "type": [
        "object",
        "null"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "x-owner": "plataforma"
    },
    "holdings_summary": {
      "type": [
        "object",
        "null"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "has_holdings",
        "full_holdings_loaded"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "has_holdings": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "positions_count": {
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ],
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "top10_weight": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "as_of_date": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "full_holdings_loaded": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      },
      "description": "Resumen de holdings en la raiz. Hoy lo escriben fund_ingest e improve_fund_data (app); el republish lo conserva. Pendiente: que lo derive holdingsRepublish.",
      "x-owner": "app"
    },
    "quality": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "status",
        "warnings",
        "validation_errors",
        "review_flags"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "fondosdb_bucket": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "fondosdb_ok": {
          "type": [
            "boolean",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "warnings": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "validation_errors": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "review_flags": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "status": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "ACCEPTED",
            "REVIEW",
            "REJECTED"
          ]
        }
      },
      "x-owner": "plataforma"
    },
    "source_metadata": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "source"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "source": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "FondosDB",
            "MANUAL_DOCUMENTARY"
          ]
        },
        "source_file": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "generated_at": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "report_date": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "universal_export_present": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "firestore_preview_only": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "source_detail": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "Fuente documental concreta de un alta MANUAL_DOCUMENTARY (p.ej. 'Andbank/CNMV')."
        },
        "registered_by": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "Proceso que hizo el alta documental (ruta del script o run_id)."
        }
      },
      "x-owner": "plataforma"
    },
    "regulatory": {
      "type": [
        "object",
        "null"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "x-owner": "plataforma",
      "description": "NUEVO v1.2. Bloque regulatorio del extractor (canonico regulatory, core/canonico_regulatorio.py). El mapper copia solo las claves declaradas; registers, periodic_report y mifid_ex_ante_costs son passthrough.",
      "properties": {
        "version": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "sri": {
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ],
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 7
        },
        "srri": {
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ],
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 7
        },
        "kid": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/kidDocument"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "mifid_ex_ante_costs": {
          "type": [
            "object",
            "null"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": true
        },
        "ucits": {
          "type": [
            "boolean",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "legal_framework": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "sfdr_article": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "domicile": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "management_company": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "management_company_legal": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "management_company_lei": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "lei": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "depositary": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "launch_date_class": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "launch_date_fund": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "isin_issue_date": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "registers": {
          "type": [
            "object",
            "null"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": true
        },
        "periodic_report": {
          "type": [
            "object",
            "null"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": true
        }
      }
    },
    "provenance": {
      "type": [
        "object",
        "null"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "x-owner": "plataforma",
      "description": "NUEVO v1.2. Procedencia por campo del canonico (provenance.fields: ruta canonica -> 'fuente:endpoint'). Version compacta: endpoints, plan, sources y dependency se quedan en el canonico.",
      "required": [
        "fields"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "version": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "acquired_at": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "fields": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "retrocession": {
      "type": [
        "number",
        "null"
      ],
      "description": "Heredado de la interfaz Asset base; en la practica la retrocesion vive en costs.retrocession.",
      "x-owner": "legado"
    }
  },
  "allOf": [
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "product": {
            "properties": {
              "has_listing": {
                "const": true
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "has_listing"
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "product"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "listings"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "$defs": {
    "listing": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "listing_id",
        "ticker",
        "currency"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "listing_id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "ticker": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "exchange": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "currency": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "eodhd_code": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "source_listing_id": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "figi": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "is_primary": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "data_sources": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "documentEvidence": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "url",
        "source"
      ],
      "description": "Documento que respalda un dato (KID, folleto, ficha). sha256 es el del texto o del binario segun la fuente: no se exige que sea reproducible byte a byte.",
      "properties": {
        "url": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "source": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "sha256": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "date": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "date_precision": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "day",
            "month"
          ]
        },
        "language": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "document_type": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "verified_isin": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "verified_at": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "checked_at": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "recommended_holding_years": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "sri": {
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ],
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 7
        },
        "verification_run": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "evidence": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "resolved_url": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "sriKidEvidence": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "sri",
        "date",
        "url",
        "sha256",
        "document_type",
        "verified_isin",
        "source",
        "verified_at"
      ],
      "description": "Prueba documental del SRI PRIIPs de la clase. La deriva el mapper de regulatory.kid (procedencia oficial del extractor); el read model solo etiqueta SRI_KID si sri == risk.sri_kid_1a7 y verified_isin == asset_id.",
      "properties": {
        "sri": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 7
        },
        "date": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "url": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "sha256": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "document_type": {
          "type": "string",
          "const": "PRIIPS_KID"
        },
        "verified_isin": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "source": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "verified_at": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "verification_run": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "evidence": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "language": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "recommended_holding_years": {
          "type": "number"
        }
      }
    },
    "kidDocument": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "url",
        "source"
      ],
      "description": "KID PRIIPs de la clase tal como lo adquiere el extractor (regulatory.kid del canonico). sri/verified_isin/document_type/checked_at son la atestacion explicita que se propone al extractor; mientras no la emita, el mapper la deduce de provenance.",
      "properties": {
        "url": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "source": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "sha256": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "date": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "language": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "recommended_holding_years": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "manufacturer": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "costs": {
          "type": [
            "object",
            "null"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "entry_pct": {
              "type": [
                "number",
                "null"
              ]
            },
            "exit_pct": {
              "type": [
                "number",
                "null"
              ]
            },
            "management_and_other_pct": {
              "type": [
                "number",
                "null"
              ]
            },
            "transaction_pct": {
              "type": [
                "number",
                "null"
              ]
            },
            "performance_fee_pct": {
              "type": [
                "number",
                "null"
              ],
              "description": "Fila «Comisiones de rendimiento» del KID tal como la lee el parser: segun el productor es el impacto anual o el tipo contractual (76 KID del 13-10 traen 5-20 %). No se copia a costs."
            }
          }
        },
        "sri": {
